The '''South Reaches''' are a sub-location of the [[Moonglade Marsh]].

== Features ==
The '''South Reaches''' are a series of large plateaus connected by bridges with [[Fig Log|Fig Tree]]s to chop. Additionally, [[Lushlilac|Lushlilac Bushes]] can be picked for {{Item|Lushlilac}}.

=== Moonglade Beacon ===
{{Main|Moonglade Beacon}}
{{NPCSprite|Boris}} introduces the player to the [[Moonglade Beacon]], which is an island-wide effect that grants all players {{Stat|Fig Fortune}} and {{Stat|Mangrove Fortune}} depending on its current stack and signal strength. Successfully tuning the color, speed, and pitch of the frequency grants {{Green|+1}} stack to all players and lasts for {{Green|20}} minutes.

The signal strength can be increased with a {{Item|Signal Enhancer}}, which can be obtained from [[Tree Gift]]s.

=== Trial of Blue Flames ===
{{Main|Trial of Blue Flames}}
{{NPCSprite|Brian}} is the leader of the {{Turquoise|Soul Campfire Cult}}. Unlike the [[Trial of Fire]], the [[Trial of Blue Flames]] calculates {{Stat|def}}. Completing a trial upgrades the {{Item|Soul Campfire Initiate Badge|text=Soul Campfire Badge}}.

=== Sawyer ===
{{Main|Sawyer}}
{{NPCSprite|Sawyer}} introduces the player to [[Boosters]] and sells a {{Item|Foraging Fortune Booster}}.

